  "description": {
   "value": "<p>Once per turn when you hit a creature with a fang attack, you can force the creature to take a Strength saving throw (DC 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Strength modifier). On a failed save, the target is dragged down and falls prone. You must have the <em>Cursed Weapon</em> attribute and choose fang to take this attribute.</p>",
